<title>USA: Norcen Energy Resources sells debentures. [CORRECTED 20:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Norcen Energy Resources sells debentures. [CORRECTED 20:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Norcen Energy Resources Ltd was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Norcen Energy Resources ltd, is based in Calgary, Alberta, and is an independent exploration and production company.</p>
<p>BORROWER NORCEN ENERGY RESOURCES LTD</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 6.80 PCT   MATURITY 7/2/2002</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 99.807  FIRST PAY DATE 1/2/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD 6.846 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD 50/WI 5 YR CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>(Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Corrects maturity date to read 7/2/2002 instead of 7/1/2002 and first pay date to 1/2/1998 instead of 1/1/1998).</p>
</text>
